OL,3,A'We simply don't know' - JP Morgan
OL,4,Astruggling to forecast oil prices due
OL,5,Ato Trump's war with Iran
OL,6,
OL,7,FInvestment banking giant JP Morgan has
OL,8,Fsaid it is struggling to predict how
OL,9,Foil prices will be impacted by the
OL,10,FUS-Iran war, telling investors in a
OL,11,Frare note that "we simply don't know
OL,12,Fhow to model the endgame".
OL,14,FThe bank said it assumed at the start
OL,15,Fof the conflict that there would be
OL,16,F"economic red lines" that the Trump
OL,17,Fadministration would be unwilling to
OL,18,Fcross, and therefore it believed a deal
OL,19,Fwould have been struck to open up the
OL,20,FStrait of Hormuz shipping lane back in
OL,21,FJune.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
