OL,3,A'We simply don't know' - JP Morgan
OL,4,Astruggling to forecast oil prices due
OL,5,Ato Trump's war with Iran
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt said such red lines included oil
OL,8,Fprices rising above $100 a barrel,
OL,9,Finflation reaching 4%, gasoline topping
OL,10,F$5 a gallon and rates on 10-year
OL,11,Fgovernment borrowing hitting 5%.
OL,13,F"The market is on edge," analysts said.
